The '''Prison''' is an island west of the [[Fountain City]] that hosts quests for players [[Levels]] 190-250.

==Appearance==
The Prison is a large, circular fortress consisting of two main walls — an inner and outer layer. The dock at the front leads to the main gate, which is flanked by two blue-roofed towers. Upon entering through the gate, players will find a spacious grassy area with several trees and a small castle located toward the back. Between the two walls lies a water-filled area covered with wooden platforms, where prisoners are found and can be fought.

